{"id":"5706","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5706_main_funnel-cloud-cold-air-funnel_hydrometeors-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">漏斗云</span>是从积状云（浓积云或积雨云）的云底发展而成，它与低压槽有关，位于英国英格兰东北部上空的阵性北风气流中。</p>\n<p>虽然所有的龙卷最开始都有漏斗云发展，随后触及地面，本图所示的冷空气漏斗源于局部对流和切变涡旋，与大型中尺度气旋无关。冷空气漏斗通常由浓积云或积雨云发展而来。它们通常不会触及地面，但如果触及地面（例如陆龙卷），其强度远低于与中尺度气旋有关的龙卷。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Lewins","location":"英国，英格兰，诺森伯兰郡，罗斯伯里","latitude":"纬度: 55° 16' 22'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 59' 36'' W","date":"27 August 2010 1418 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.11.5.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.11.5.1.5"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5706_syn_funnel-cloud-cold-air-funnel_hydrometeors-special-clouds-and-other-features.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在欧洲大陆的英国以南出现了一系列的锋。英国英格兰北部受到了不稳定偏北气流和低压槽的影响。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5706_upper_funnel-cloud-cold-air-funnel_hydrometeors-special-clouds-and-other-features.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>同样在英国英格兰诺森伯兰郡附近地区的高空上升探测显示出白天温度的不稳定廓线。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5706_sat_funnel-cloud-cold-air-funnel_hydrometeors-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在照片拍摄2小时内的MSG卫星图像显示出与经威尔士延伸到英国英格兰东北部的低压槽有关的对流单体。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2010","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5721_main_funnel-cloud-cold-air-funnel_hydrometeors-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">漏斗云</span>是一种龙卷。该冷空气漏斗是从英国威尔士南部沿海上空不稳定气流中的积状云底发展而成。</p>\n<p>图中这类冷空气漏斗源于局部对流和与浓积云或积雨云有关的切变涡旋，而与大规模中尺度气旋无关。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tim Bow","location":"英国，威尔士，波斯考尔，雷斯特湾","latitude":"纬度: 51° 29' 30'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 43' 23'' W","date":"07 October 2014 1817 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.11.5.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.11.5.1.5"}]}]}